{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026d1tY6ugfaa1795048362.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>信貸評級機構穆迪把輝達Nvidia的前景評級，由「正面」降至「穩定」。</p><p></p><p>穆迪認為，黃仁勳辭去輝達行政總裁，加上公司缺乏正式接班計劃，令公司的業務發展策略，以及財政政策變得不明朗，也可能影響未來增長策略，因為輝達以往靠AI生態系統中的龐大關係網絡支撐增長。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.098846+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T18:15:10.581698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:16.398436+00:00","content_hash":"f00a9da4bb70c64232add5c48e4cffa50e2d70d1a4348433f3a240a35615acf8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.098846+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}